WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.299
Lesson 8: Brainstorming with structure

2
00:00:03.449 --> 00:00:08.635
"What could the client do?" is still a structuring question. Use buckets, not a list.

3
00:00:08.885 --> 00:00:10.358
Three things to remember.

4
00:00:10.378 --> 00:00:13.135
Two or three buckets, then ideas under each.

5
00:00:13.335 --> 00:00:15.765
One real example, used sparingly.

6
00:00:15.965 --> 00:00:17.468
Finish with a priority.

7
00:00:17.668 --> 00:00:22.408
The full lesson has a worked example, an exercise, and a quick quiz.
